It's so weird, what's going on? Wait! I get it— so why is summer hot anyway? Why? I'm genuinely curious...

22
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:16,100
Hey stop it Pekora, don't put me on the same level— like, I didn't even know you were there earlier. Global warming? Global warming. The ocean temperature is high. See? You guys used to that?

23
