37
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:57,440
Matsuri-senpai having this kind of high-IQ conversation is so out of character, please stop

38
00:01:57,440 --> 00:01:59,540
Please stop

39
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:01,540
Please stop, please stop

40
00:02:01,540 --> 00:02:04,840
