41
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,840
No no no no, she doesn't, she doesn't

42
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:13,300
So when the Earth orbits the sun, it's not always facing it straight on—

43
00:02:13,300 --> 00:02:14,300
