Is this one just not openable?

1611
01:07:04,690 --> 01:07:11,070
Oh, this one — with the key, the red door, the red door looks doable!

1612
01:07:11,070 --> 01:07:13,750
Looks good, looks good!

1613
01:07:18,950 --> 01:07:20,400
Wait, are you getting blown away?

1614
01:07:20,400 --> 01:07:21,250
Is there wind blowing?

1615
01:07:21,250 --> 01:07:22,250
Whoa, amazing!

1616
01:07:22,250 --> 01:07:24,050
Makes sense, there's a helipad after all

1617
01:07:24,050 --> 01:07:25,850
Must be pretty high up, huh?

1618
01:07:25,850 --> 01:07:27,850
Alright, open it for me!

1619
01:07:27,850 --> 01:07:30,150
"Get stung by a bee" — what's that?

1620
01:07:30,150 --> 01:07:32,150
Oh right, I should check the tasks

1621
01:07:32,150 --> 01:07:34,150
"Get stung by a bee," "open a cabinet," "open a window"

1622
01:07:34,150 --> 01:07:36,150
Open a cabinet — can we do something with the riff?

1623
01:07:36,150 --> 01:07:37,120
Yeah, for sure

1624
01:07:37,120 --> 01:07:40,450
"Steal hygiene products," "find a way into the shed"

1625
01:07:40,450 --> 01:07:41,950
The shed — isn't that the one nearby?

1626
01:07:41,950 --> 01:07:45,750
The shed — isn't that the square thing on the side?

1627
01:07:46,050 --> 01:07:48,050
That's it! What is it?

1628
01:07:48,050 --> 01:07:50,850
For real! Give it your all!

1629
01:07:50,850 --> 01:07:53,850
Were you heading toward this door?

1630
01:07:53,850 --> 01:07:54,850
Is it a hold?

1631
01:07:54,850 --> 01:07:56,850
We're in! We made it!

1632
01:07:56,850 --> 01:08:00,660
Yes!!

1633
01:08:00,660 --> 01:08:02,630
There's someone upstairs!

1634
01:08:02,630 --> 01:08:05,310
That was close!

1635
01:08:05,310 --> 01:08:07,140
That was close!

1636
01:08:07,140 --> 01:08:10,740
You okay?

1637
01:08:10,740 --> 01:08:11,740
What do I do!

1638
01:08:11,740 --> 01:08:14,540
We got in! Barely! If you go left right away—

1639
01:08:14,540 --> 01:08:18,040
Go left! Watch out, they're reaching out!

1640
01:08:18,040 --> 01:08:19,650
That was close!

1641
01:08:19,650 --> 01:08:22,840
So cute!

1642
01:08:22,840 --> 01:08:25,790
Oh look! This, this — it turned into a part!

1643
01:08:25,790 --> 01:08:27,540
Nene, pick this up — oh, you're right!

1644
01:08:27,540 --> 01:08:30,610
Oh, I picked it up! Nice!

1645
01:08:30,610 --> 01:08:34,040
Okay, let's open the cabinets and break the windows too

1646
01:08:34,040 --> 01:08:36,440
The pickaxe has a use limit — cabinets too

1647
01:08:36,440 --> 01:08:37,940
Oh really?

1648
01:08:37,940 --> 01:08:40,240
What are hygiene products?

1649
01:08:40,240 --> 01:08:41,980
Oh, it's a dead end...

1650
01:08:41,980 --> 01:08:43,460
There's nothing here!

1651
01:08:43,460 --> 01:08:45,240
Oh wait — Roomba alert! Roomba alert!

1652
01:08:45,240 --> 01:08:46,300
Roomba alert!

1653
01:08:46,300 --> 01:08:47,340
You can light up, right?!

1654
01:08:47,340 --> 01:08:48,180
Yeah, that's right!

1655
01:08:48,180 --> 01:08:49,220
Roomba alert!

1656
01:08:49,220 --> 01:08:52,720
The kitchen? Are you heading to the kitchen?

1657
01:08:52,720 --> 01:08:53,660
The kitchen?

1658
01:08:53,660 --> 01:08:54,260
Yeah

1659
01:08:54,260 --> 01:08:56,560
Over here...

1660
01:08:56,560 --> 01:08:59,160
Oh, but there are cabinets here that can be opened

1661
01:08:59,160 --> 01:09:00,260
Oh, is it below?

1662
01:09:00,260 --> 01:09:02,740
Oh, here we go! The kitchen!

1663
01:09:02,740 --> 01:09:05,200
Oh, but the task is already done

1664
01:09:05,200 --> 01:09:05,940
There we go

1665
01:09:07,060 --> 01:09:09,660
There's definitely something in the sand

1666
01:09:09,660 --> 01:09:11,060
Oh, bread!

1667
01:09:11,060 --> 01:09:13,160
Bread — I want to take this home

1668
01:09:13,160 --> 01:09:14,160
Go ahead~

1669
01:09:14,160 --> 01:09:15,960
Bread, bread, bread

1670
01:09:15,960 --> 01:09:18,860
Wait, to get to the exit we have to pass by that old man?

1671
01:09:18,860 --> 01:09:19,360
Yeah, that's true

1672
01:09:19,360 --> 01:09:20,760
Oh, but there's a window over here! A window!

1673
01:09:20,760 --> 01:09:22,260
Oh, it broke!

1674
01:09:22,260 --> 01:09:23,960
It broke

1675
01:09:23,960 --> 01:09:25,760
Huh?

1676
01:09:25,760 --> 01:09:27,960
Ooh~

1677
01:09:27,960 --> 01:09:29,260
It opens right away

1678
01:09:29,260 --> 01:09:31,160
This...

1679
01:09:31,160 --> 01:09:33,160
I can't reach it from here

1680
01:09:33,160 --> 01:09:36,280
Yeah, how do you get it up there?

1681
01:09:36,280 --> 01:09:37,300
Oh, here they come!

1682
01:09:37,300 --> 01:09:39,380
Nice, nice, nice, nice, nice!

1683
01:09:39,380 --> 01:09:41,440
This one too, please!

1684
01:09:41,440 --> 01:09:42,540
I wonder if this breaks?

1685
01:09:42,540 --> 01:09:44,880
Oh, that breaks — it breaks, it broke just now!

1686
01:09:44,880 --> 01:09:47,260
How do I place this outside?

1687
01:09:47,260 --> 01:09:48,540
Please!

1688
01:09:48,540 --> 01:09:50,240
Please!

1689
01:09:50,240 --> 01:09:51,620
It's falling!

1690
01:09:51,620 --> 01:09:53,220
Matsuri-senpai, please!

1691
01:09:53,220 --> 01:09:54,340
Please!

1692
01:09:54,340 --> 01:09:56,840
Cut off this leg—

1693
01:09:56,840 --> 01:09:59,500
There's someone with a knife, just face them—

1694
01:09:59,500 --> 01:10:01,840
So what happens if you resist?

1695
01:10:02,360 --> 01:10:04,360
That's terrifying!

1696
01:10:04,360 --> 01:10:09,360
You can do this!

1697
01:10:15,690 --> 01:10:20,690
Sorry! Sorry!

1698
01:10:28,500 --> 01:10:29,500
Can you do CPR?

1699
01:10:29,500 --> 01:10:30,500
You can't?

1700
01:10:30,500 --> 01:10:31,500
How do you do it?

1701
01:10:31,500 --> 01:10:33,500
My body's already a mess—

1702
01:10:33,500 --> 01:10:35,500
It says to get CPR done on me.

1703
01:10:35,500 --> 01:10:36,500
There's bone sticking out!

1704
01:10:36,500 --> 01:10:39,100
Split Catcher or CPR?

1705
01:10:39,100 --> 01:10:42,100
Wait, did the CPR option disappear?

1706
01:10:42,100 --> 01:10:44,100
Ow! I shot myself!

1707
01:10:46,100 --> 01:10:49,100
What are you saying?! You killed someone and now you shoot yourself!

1708
01:10:49,100 --> 01:10:50,100
What are you saying?! You killed someone and now you shoot yourself!

1709
01:10:50,100 --> 01:10:51,100
What are you saying?! That hurts!

1710
01:10:51,100 --> 01:10:52,100
What are you saying?! You killed someone and now you shoot yourself!

1711
01:10:52,100 --> 01:10:53,100
That hurts!

1712
01:10:53,100 --> 01:10:54,900
That's dangerous!

1713
01:10:54,900 --> 01:10:58,500
What's this?

1714
01:10:58,500 --> 01:11:02,500
If you throw this at the old man, won't he get hurt?

1715
01:11:02,500 --> 01:11:03,500
True!

1716
01:11:03,500 --> 01:11:04,500
Kill him!

1717
01:11:04,500 --> 01:11:06,500
Go go go!

1718
01:11:06,500 --> 01:11:12,300
I got caught!

1719
01:11:12,300 --> 01:11:14,300
She's caught!

1720
01:11:15,300 --> 01:11:20,120
Aaahh, gotta grab this—

1721
01:11:20,120 --> 01:11:29,020
So this side is toys... the old man's picture looks like he's laughing. He really is laughing!

1722
01:11:29,020 --> 01:11:35,980
So scary — getting Bach'd. There's a bee somewhere. What's this — is it an egg?

1723
01:11:35,980 --> 01:11:37,780
Looks like an egg?

1724
01:11:37,780 --> 01:11:39,580
How do you throw this?

1725
01:11:39,580 --> 01:11:41,380
Oh, ouch—

1726
01:11:41,380 --> 01:11:43,380
I still have to chase after them—

1727
01:11:43,380 --> 01:11:45,380
There's only one window... what about Riona?

1728
01:11:45,380 --> 01:11:47,180
Riona's dead so she went—

1729
01:11:47,180 --> 01:11:49,180
Should I go wake her up?

1730
01:11:49,180 --> 01:11:51,180
Sorry, Nene messed up.

1731
01:11:51,180 --> 01:11:53,180
Otherwise this door and stuff—

1732
01:11:53,180 --> 01:11:54,980
Can't be opened, right?

1733
01:11:54,980 --> 01:11:56,980
From where Riona died—

1734
01:11:56,980 --> 01:11:58,980
A purple—

1735
01:11:58,980 --> 01:12:00,800
I picked up an item!

1736
01:12:00,800 --> 01:12:02,780
Wait, really? Then maybe we can open it!

1737
01:12:02,780 --> 01:12:04,780
That item... Azuki-senpai might have it.

1738
01:12:04,780 --> 01:12:06,700
I have it. Select this—

1739
01:12:06,700 --> 01:12:10,420
Then click toward this door.

1740
01:12:10,420 --> 01:12:12,300
Click — there's like a whirring sound—

1741
01:12:12,300 --> 01:12:13,340
That's — oh, that's the thing, right?

1742
01:12:13,340 --> 01:12:15,180
1

1743
01:12:15,180 --> 01:12:17,300
And over here, this front entrance—

1744
01:12:17,300 --> 01:12:18,380
Well, not really an entrance — Revive!

1745
01:12:18,380 --> 01:12:21,060
The human door — thank you so much!

1746
01:12:21,060 --> 01:12:22,060
Oh, is it this way? This way? This way?

1747
01:12:22,060 --> 01:12:24,780
Huh? This way? There's a fairy! A fairy!

1748
01:12:24,780 --> 01:12:25,500
Huh? What?

1749
01:12:25,500 --> 01:12:26,380
It really is! It's a fairy!

1750
01:12:26,380 --> 01:12:28,020
On the ground! A kind person?

1751
01:12:28,020 --> 01:12:29,260
Huh? What is this?

1752
01:12:29,260 --> 01:12:35,060
Lee! Lee! Lee! Push? Push? Lee is holding something up! Wait, some kind of fairy!

1753
01:12:35,060 --> 01:12:39,660
For real, I don't have it! Oh no! What? This is bad!

1754
01:12:39,660 --> 01:12:42,640
Huh, it won't open? What, what, what? Scary!

1755
01:12:42,640 --> 01:12:46,460
Can't go here? Seems like this one won't open.

1756
01:12:46,460 --> 01:12:51,060
Too scary! Oh, apparently the fairy wants junk, so if someone...

1757
01:12:51,060 --> 01:12:54,860
If someone has junk, give it to the fairy at the entrance... it wants junk...

1758
01:12:54,860 --> 01:12:55,860
Seems like it'll give something good in return.

1759
01:12:55,860 --> 01:12:57,860
Wait, you got taken out by the fairy?

1760
01:12:57,860 --> 01:12:59,660
If you punch the fairy—

1761
01:12:59,660 --> 01:13:00,660
and got hit with a beam from its eyes

1762
01:13:00,660 --> 01:13:01,660
Why did you punch it?

1763
01:13:01,660 --> 01:13:05,660
There's some junk in the storage box here,

1764
01:13:05,660 --> 01:13:06,660
can I try giving it to them?

1765
01:13:06,660 --> 01:13:07,660
Oh, sure, go ahead!

1766
01:13:07,660 --> 01:13:08,660
Sheesh.

1767
01:13:08,660 --> 01:13:09,460
Here you go.

1768
01:13:09,460 --> 01:13:10,460
Looks like they might give us something good.

1769
01:13:10,460 --> 01:13:11,460
Oh, they disappeared.

1770
01:13:11,460 --> 01:13:12,460
Gloves!

1771
01:13:12,460 --> 01:13:13,460
We got boxing gloves!

1772
01:13:13,460 --> 01:13:14,460
Nice!

1773
01:13:14,460 --> 01:13:15,460
With those, you can punch all kinds of things.

1774
01:13:15,460 --> 01:13:16,460
Oh, so that's how it works.

1775
01:13:16,460 --> 01:13:17,460
They gave us some!

1776
01:13:17,460 --> 01:13:18,430
Like this?

1777
01:13:18,430 --> 01:13:19,260
Can this open?

1778
01:13:19,260 --> 01:13:22,060
The door's...

1779
01:13:22,060 --> 01:13:23,060
toward the lock, I mean

1780
01:13:23,060 --> 01:13:24,220
Oh, it's a key!

1781
01:13:24,220 --> 01:13:24,720
I was doing it!

1782
01:13:24,720 --> 01:13:25,660
Ahhh!

1783
01:13:25,660 --> 01:13:26,160
Got it.

1784
01:13:26,160 --> 01:13:27,700
Yeah, like that — you pull it.

1785
01:13:27,700 --> 01:13:28,200
Let me place it.

1786
01:13:28,200 --> 01:13:30,300
Oh, it's open! It's open!

1787
01:13:30,300 --> 01:13:31,200
Yep!

1788
01:13:31,200 --> 01:13:31,700
Okay!

1789
01:13:31,700 --> 01:13:32,680
It's open!

1790
01:13:32,680 --> 01:13:33,900
Nice!

1791
01:13:33,900 --> 01:13:34,500
It's a bathroom!

1792
01:13:34,500 --> 01:13:35,540
A bathroom!

1793
01:13:35,540 --> 01:13:37,540
We just gotta watch out for the old man.

1794
01:13:37,540 --> 01:13:38,680
The old man's looking over here.

1795
01:13:38,680 --> 01:13:39,940
What was it again?

1796
01:13:39,940 --> 01:13:43,040
Aren't there hygiene products in there?

1797
01:13:43,040 --> 01:13:43,540
What do you think?

1798
01:13:43,540 --> 01:13:44,780
Oh, isn't that a hair dryer?

1799
01:13:44,780 --> 01:13:46,180
Is a hair dryer a hygiene product?

1800
01:13:46,180 --> 01:13:46,720
It's merchandise.

1801
01:13:46,720 --> 01:13:47,880
It's merchandise, it's merchandise!

1802
01:13:47,880 --> 01:13:48,760
It's merchandise!

1803
01:13:48,760 --> 01:13:49,260
Heave-ho.

1804
01:13:49,260 --> 01:13:50,260
Oh, this is where Nene...

1805
01:13:50,260 --> 01:13:50,960
Hmm, I wonder.

1806
01:13:50,960 --> 01:13:53,440
Where was the bag I supposedly dropped?

1807
01:13:53,440 --> 01:13:54,900
Should I drop that thing from above?

1808
01:13:54,900 --> 01:13:55,900
Open it.

1809
01:13:55,900 --> 01:13:58,720
Let's go to the second floor!

1810
01:13:58,720 --> 01:13:59,060
Here we go.

1811
01:13:59,060 --> 01:14:01,780
If you hand it over here,

1812
01:14:01,780 --> 01:14:02,580
can we make it?

1813
01:14:02,580 --> 01:14:04,440
Hmm, maybe not from here.

1814
01:14:04,440 --> 01:14:05,840
Let's try from this side.

1815
01:14:05,840 --> 01:14:07,960
Find a way into the storage room.

1816
01:14:07,960 --> 01:14:08,440
What about this?

1817
01:14:08,440 --> 01:14:10,780
Put it up top first,

1818
01:14:10,780 --> 01:14:13,120
then have me climb up too,

1819
01:14:13,120 --> 01:14:14,660
and cross over to the other side.

1820
01:14:14,660 --> 01:14:15,220
Got it.

1821
01:14:15,220 --> 01:14:17,740
Whoa, the hair dryer is amazing!

1822
01:14:17,740 --> 01:14:20,540
It does seem kinda like a hygiene product.

1823
01:14:20,540 --> 01:14:22,540
It does seem kinda like a hygiene product.

1824
01:14:22,540 --> 01:14:25,540
Oh, and I want you to break the window with that too.

1825
01:14:25,540 --> 01:14:27,340
Huh?

1826
01:14:27,340 --> 01:14:31,140
Oh, there's soap!

1827
01:14:31,140 --> 01:14:32,140
Wait, really?

1828
01:14:32,140 --> 01:14:33,920
Nice?

1829
01:14:33,920 --> 01:14:34,740
This one.

1830
01:14:34,740 --> 01:14:35,540
Oh, ouch.

1831
01:14:35,540 --> 01:14:37,340
Huh?

1832
01:14:37,340 --> 01:14:40,140
Oh, you're right! There's soap!

1833
01:14:40,140 --> 01:14:43,940
But that's not relevant this time, huh.

1834
01:14:43,940 --> 01:14:45,740
It's not relevant this time! The soap!

1835
01:14:45,740 --> 01:14:52,540
Don't let it get flushed.

1836
01:14:52,540 --> 01:14:54,340
Don't let it get flushed.

1837
01:14:54,340 --> 01:14:55,340
You okay?

1838
01:14:55,340 --> 01:14:57,140
When you say it like that...

1839
01:14:57,140 --> 01:14:58,940
it makes you want to flush it?

1840
01:14:58,940 --> 01:14:59,940
Makes you want to flush it!

1841
01:14:59,940 --> 01:15:01,740
Give me a break.

1842
01:15:01,740 --> 01:15:04,540
Can that be broken? Nice!

1843
01:15:04,540 --> 01:15:05,380
Nice!

1844
01:15:05,380 --> 01:15:07,140
Points!

1845
01:15:07,140 --> 01:15:08,080
Points!

1846
01:15:08,080 --> 01:15:08,940
Is this the hygiene landmark?

1847
01:15:08,940 --> 01:15:10,940
Isn't it hygiene products?

1848
01:15:10,940 --> 01:15:13,940
Like soap stuff?

1849
01:15:13,940 --> 01:15:16,940
Soap? But we're supposed to steal it?

1850
01:15:16,940 --> 01:15:18,740
Toss it outside once—

1851
01:15:18,740 --> 01:15:20,740
Let me grab this first.

1852
01:15:20,740 --> 01:15:23,540
Then toss it to Azu-chan outside.

1853
01:15:23,540 --> 01:15:29,210
No good?

1854
01:15:29,210 --> 01:15:31,010
Hold on.

1855
01:15:31,010 --> 01:15:34,010
Hygiene products include towels, apparently.

1856
01:15:34,010 --> 01:15:35,010
But soap is in there too.

1857
01:15:35,010 --> 01:15:37,010
Soap, brushes, towels.

1858
01:15:37,610 --> 01:15:43,750
Up, up, up — send Matchuu up here!

1859
01:15:43,750 --> 01:15:46,370
Matchuu goes and opens the door—

1860
01:15:46,370 --> 01:15:51,810
Open the door — nice! Here we go, here we go!

1861
01:15:51,810 --> 01:15:56,010
Looks like we need to find a way into the shed.

1862
01:15:55,810 --> 01:16:04,410
The shed? Can I drop this? Break it? Wait, is this area done? It's done! Okay, it's done!

1863
01:16:04,410 --> 01:16:06,400
We need to get lured by the bee.

1864
01:16:06,400 --> 01:16:08,010
Oh, OK!

1865
01:16:08,010 --> 01:16:09,010
This side still needs work.

1866
01:16:09,010 --> 01:16:10,810
Where's the bee?

1867
01:16:10,810 --> 01:16:12,810
Is the bee outside?

1868
01:16:12,810 --> 01:16:15,610
This might break it, maybe.

1869
01:16:15,610 --> 01:16:18,410
Wait, Azu-chan, there are marbles here!

1870
01:16:18,410 --> 01:16:21,210
Isn't that the thing? Marbles?

1871
01:16:21,210 --> 01:16:22,210
Can you break it with marbles?

1872
01:16:22,210 --> 01:16:23,210
Like a slingshot?

1873
01:16:23,210 --> 01:16:25,210
Yeah yeah, slingshot, slingshot, slingshot!

1874
01:16:25,210 --> 01:16:27,210
A slingshot? Can you do that?

1875
01:16:27,210 --> 01:16:29,210
Wait, how did Pekora—

1876
01:16:29,210 --> 01:16:31,210
Peko-chan, how did you climb up?

1877
01:16:31,210 --> 01:16:32,210
Yeah, how did you get up there?

1878
01:16:32,210 --> 01:16:35,570
